        "parts": [
          {
            "text": "```json\n{\n  \"findings\": [\n    {\n      \"clauseType\": \"Anti-Assignment\",\n      \"characterization\": \"QUALIFIED\",\n      \"quote\": \"Except as otherwise provided herein, a Party shall not have the right to   assign any of its rights or obligations under this Agreement (whether through a merger, sale of stock, or otherwise) without the   prior written consent of the other Party;\",\n      \"overrideQuote\": \"except that, either Party shall be permitted, without any need for the other Party's   consent, to assign this Agreement (a) in whole or in part to an Affiliate (provided, however, that once such Person is no longer an   Affiliate of the assigning Party, such former Affiliate shall assign this Agreement back to the assigning Party), provided that the   assigning Party provides the other Party notice of any such assignment provided further that failure to provide such notice of such   assignment shall not render such assignment void; or (b) to a Third Party in connection with sale or transfer of all or substantially all   of the assigning Party's business or assets relating to the subject matter of this Agreement, whether by Change of Control, merger,   sale of assets or otherwise;\",\n      \"note\": \"Assignment is generally prohibited without prior written consent, but permitted without consent to an Affiliate or in connection with the sale/transfer of substantially all related business/assets.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clauseType\": \"Change Of Control\",\n      \"characterization\": \"QUALIFIED\",\n      \"quote\": \"Except as otherwise provided herein, a Party shall not have the right to   assign any of its rights or obligations under this Agreement (whether through a merger, sale of stock, or otherwise) without the   prior written consent of the other Party;\",\n      \"overrideQuote\": \"For the purposes of this Agreement, a transaction in which the ultimate beneficial ownership of a party remains substantially unchanged, including any internal reorganisation, recapitalisation, or transaction effected solely to alter the jurisdiction of incorporation of that party, does not constitute a change of control, an acquisition, or a transfer of control of that party. The rights and obligations arising under this Agreement upon a change of control have no application to any such transaction.\",\n      \"note\": \"Change of control restrictions apply to assignments and transfers, but transactions where ultimate beneficial ownership remains substantially unchanged are exempted from constituting a change of control.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clauseType\": \"Exclusivity\",\n      \"characterization\": \"QUALIFIED\",\n      \"quote\": \"Except as specifically provided in the Distribution Agreement, Conformis shall be prohibited from   developing or assisting another in developing, or causing another to develop, Patient-Specific Instrumentation for Off-The-Shelf   Knee Implants for any Third Party in the field of orthopedics until January 1, 2032 (or earlier, to the extent set forth in Section   2.3.3.4 or Section 2.3.5 of the Distribution Agreement)\",\n      \"overrideQuote\": \"with the exception that Conformis (including any entity involved in a   Change of Control of Conformis, any such entity an \\\"Acquirer\\\"), may develop Patient-Specific Instrumentation for any Off-The-   Shelf Implants of Conformis, an Acquirer or any of their Affiliates.\",\n      \"note\": \"Conformis is subject to an exclusivity covenant prohibiting development for third parties until 2032, subject to exceptions for its own, an Acquirer's, or its Affiliates' off-the-shelf implants and terms in the Distribution Agreement.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```",
